{"seq":1,"slug":"log-query-patterns","title":"日志查询模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-query-patterns","wordCount":1019,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"日志查询模式\">日志查询模式</h1><p>日志存储的终极价值在查询中兑现。一个设计精良的日志系统如果无法在 incident 中快速定位问题，就等于把钱花在了无人阅读的存储上。日志查询不是&quot;搜索框打几个关键词&quot;这么简单——高效的查询建立在对存储引擎索引机制的理解之上，不同的查询模式对应不同的性能代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志查询分四类：点查询（trace_id 精确定位）、范围查询（时间窗+label 过滤）、聚合查询（统计分析）、关联查询（跨信号跳转）。不同后端对应不同的查询语言——LogQL（Loki）用 stream selector + filter 范式，SQL（ClickHouse）用列式向量化扫描，ES|QL（Elasticsearch）保留全文搜索能力。查询性能的关键是利用索引机制减少扫描范围：Loki 依赖 label 选择性，ClickHouse 依赖主键前缀命中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询类型分类\">查询类型分类</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    QUERY[日志查询] --&gt; P1[点查询 - 精确查找]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; P2[范围查询 - 时间窗 + 过滤]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; P3[聚合查询 - 统计分析]&#10;    QUERY --&gt; P4[关联查询 - 跨信号跳转]&#10;    P1 --&gt; E1[&quot;通过 trace_id 定位一次请求的所有日志&quot;]&#10;    P2 --&gt; E2[&quot;最近 1h 内 service=payment 且 level=ERROR 的日志&quot;]&#10;    P3 --&gt; E3[&quot;过去 24h 每个 service 的 ERROR 日志数量 TOP-10&quot;]&#10;    P4 --&gt; E4[&quot;从一条 ERROR 日志跳转到对应的 Trace 瀑布图&quot;]\">graph TD\n    QUERY[日志查询] --&gt; P1[点查询 - 精确查找]\n    QUERY --&gt; P2[范围查询 - 时间窗 + 过滤]\n    QUERY --&gt; P3[聚合查询 - 统计分析]\n    QUERY --&gt; P4[关联查询 - 跨信号跳转]\n    P1 --&gt; E1[\"通过 trace_id 定位一次请求的所有日志\"]\n    P2 --&gt; E2[\"最近 1h 内 service=payment 且 level=ERROR 的日志\"]\n    P3 --&gt; E3[\"过去 24h 每个 service 的 ERROR 日志数量 TOP-10\"]\n    P4 --&gt; E4[\"从一条 ERROR 日志跳转到对应的 Trace 瀑布图\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>查询类型</th>\n<th align=\"center\">典型延迟目标</th>\n<th align=\"center\">数据扫描量</th>\n<th>索引依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>点查询</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;100ms</td>\n<td align=\"center\">极小（直接定位）</td>\n<td>trace_id 二级索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;3s</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中等（时间范围内全扫描）</td>\n<td>主键时间排序 + label 索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合查询</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;10s</td>\n<td align=\"center\">大（可能跨天）</td>\n<td>列式存储的向量化扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联查询</td>\n<td align=\"center\">&lt;500ms</td>\n<td align=\"center\">极小（通过 ID join）</td>\n<td>trace_id 关联索引</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"logql-查询模式-loki\">LogQL 查询模式（Loki）</h2><p>LogQL 的核心范式：先通过 <strong>stream selector</strong> 用 label 缩小范围，再通过 <strong>filter expression</strong> 做正文过滤，最后可选地接 <strong>metric query</strong> 做聚合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础模式\">基础模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 1. Stream selector + 文本过滤&#10;{service_name=&quot;api-gateway&quot;, level=&quot;ERROR&quot;} |= &quot;timeout&quot;&#10;&#10;# 2. JSON 解析 + 字段过滤&#10;{service_name=&quot;order-service&quot;} | json | duration_ms &gt; 1000&#10;&#10;# 3. Logfmt 解析&#10;{job=&quot;nginx&quot;} | logfmt | status &gt;= 500&#10;&#10;# 4. Pattern 匹配（Loki 3.x）&#10;{service_name=&quot;auth&quot;} | pattern &quot;&lt;_&gt; &lt;method&gt; &lt;path&gt; &lt;status&gt; &lt;duration&gt;&quot;&#10;                      | status &gt;= 500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 1. Stream selector + 文本过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{service_name=\"api-gateway\", level=\"ERROR\"} |= \"timeout\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 2. JSON 解析 + 字段过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{service_name=\"order-service\"} | json | duration_ms > 1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 3. Logfmt 解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{job=\"nginx\"} | logfmt | status >= 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 4. Pattern 匹配（Loki 3.x）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{service_name=\"auth\"} | pattern \"&#x3C;_> &#x3C;method> &#x3C;path> &#x3C;status> &#x3C;duration>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                      | status >= 500</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"聚合模式\">聚合模式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 每分钟 ERROR 数&#10;count_over_time({level=&quot;ERROR&quot;}[1m])&#10;&#10;# 按 service 统计 5xx 率&#10;sum by (service_name) (&#10;  count_over_time({level=&quot;ERROR&quot;} |= &quot;status=5&quot; [5m])&#10;)&#10;&#10;# P99 延迟（需提取数值字段）&#10;quantile_over_time(0.99, {service_name=&quot;payment&quot;} | json | unwrap duration_ms [5m])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 每分钟 ERROR 数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count_over_time({level=\"ERROR\"}[1m])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 按 service 统计 5xx 率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sum by (service_name) (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count_over_time({level=\"ERROR\"} |= \"status=5\" [5m])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># P99 延迟（需提取数值字段）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>quantile_over_time(0.99, {service_name=\"payment\"} | json | unwrap duration_ms [5m])</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"性能优化要诀\">性能优化要诀</h3><p>Loki 的查询性能完全依赖于 stream selector 的选择性——label 过滤越精确，需要扫描的 chunk 越少：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>QueryCost</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>TimeRange</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>MatchingStreams</mtext></mrow><mtext>Parallelism</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{QueryCost} \\propto \\frac{\\text{TimeRange} \\times \\text{MatchingStreams}}{\\text{Parallelism}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QueryCost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Parallelism</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TimeRange</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MatchingStreams</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>反模式</strong>：<code>{job=~&quot;.+&quot;}</code> — 匹配所有 stream，等于全量扫描</li>\n<li><strong>正模式</strong>：<code>{namespace=&quot;production&quot;, service_name=&quot;payment&quot;, level=&quot;ERROR&quot;}</code> — 三重 label 过滤将扫描范围收缩数百倍</li>\n<li><strong>进阶</strong>：结合 Structured Metadata 过滤（Loki 3.4+）在不增加 stream 基数的前提下按 trace_id 或 user_id 查询</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sql-查询模式-clickhouse\">SQL 查询模式（ClickHouse）</h2><p>ClickHouse 的日志查询用标准 SQL，其优势是聚合分析和多表 JOIN 能力远超 LogQL：</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础查询\">基础查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 按时间范围 + 服务 + 级别过滤&#10;SELECT timestamp, body, attributes&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE timestamp BETWEEN &#39;2026-07-18 10:00:00&#39; AND &#39;2026-07-18 11:00:00&#39;&#10;  AND service_name = &#39;payment-service&#39;&#10;  AND severity_number &gt;= 17&#10;ORDER BY timestamp DESC&#10;LIMIT 100;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按时间范围 + 服务 + 级别过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body, attributes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18 10:00:00'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18 11:00:00'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> service_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payment-service'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"分析查询\">分析查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 每 5 分钟的 ERROR 趋势&#10;SELECT&#10;    toStartOfFiveMinutes(timestamp) AS bucket,&#10;    service_name,&#10;    count() AS error_count&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE severity_number &gt;= 17&#10;  AND timestamp &gt; now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR&#10;GROUP BY bucket, service_name&#10;ORDER BY bucket DESC;&#10;&#10;-- P95 延迟（从 attributes 中提取）&#10;SELECT&#10;    service_name,&#10;    quantile(0.95)(toFloat64OrZero(attributes[&#39;duration_ms&#39;])) AS p95_ms&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE timestamp &gt; now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR&#10;GROUP BY service_name&#10;HAVING p95_ms &gt; 500&#10;ORDER BY p95_ms DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每 5 分钟的 ERROR 趋势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    toStartOfFiveMinutes(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">service_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bucket </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- P95 延迟（从 attributes 中提取）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quantile(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(toFloat64OrZero(attributes['duration_ms'])) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> service_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p95_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"clickhouse-查询性能的关键-主键排序\">ClickHouse 查询性能的关键：主键排序</h3><p>MergeTree 引擎的数据按 <code>ORDER BY</code> 声明的列排序存储。查询时如果 WHERE 条件命中主键前缀列，ClickHouse 可以通过稀疏索引跳过大量数据块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 假设 ORDER BY (service_name, severity_number, timestamp)&#10;-- 此查询命中前两个主键列，极快&#10;WHERE service_name = &#39;payment&#39; AND severity_number &gt;= 17&#10;&#10;-- 此查询跳过了 service_name，需要全量扫描主键&#10;WHERE severity_number &gt;= 17 AND body LIKE &#39;%timeout%&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 假设 ORDER BY (service_name, severity_number, timestamp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 此查询命中前两个主键列，极快</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> service_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'payment'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 此查询跳过了 service_name，需要全量扫描主键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 17</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%timeout%'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"es-ql-查询模式-elasticsearch\">ES|QL 查询模式（Elasticsearch）</h2><p>Elasticsearch 在 2024 年引入 ES|QL（管道式查询语言），提供类似 SQL 的体验但保留了全文搜索能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"FROM logs&#10;| WHERE @timestamp &gt; NOW() - 1 HOUR&#10;  AND service.name == &quot;payment&quot;&#10;  AND log.level == &quot;ERROR&quot;&#10;| STATS error_count = COUNT(*) BY service.name&#10;| SORT error_count DESC&#10;| LIMIT 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| WHERE @timestamp > NOW() - 1 HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND service.name == \"payment\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AND log.level == \"ERROR\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| STATS error_count = COUNT(*) BY service.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| SORT error_count DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>| LIMIT 10</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨信号关联查询\">跨信号关联查询</h2><p>日志的终极价值之一是作为 Trace 的&quot;放大镜&quot;——当 Trace 显示某个 Span 慢或失败时，点击进入该 Span 时段的日志可以看到具体原因。这种关联依赖 <code>trace_id</code> 和 <code>span_id</code> 字段：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Engineer as 工程师&#10;    participant Grafana as 可视化层&#10;    participant TraceDB as Trace 存储&#10;    participant LogDB as 日志存储&#10;&#10;    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Grafana: 看到 P99 延迟异常&#10;    Grafana-&gt;&gt;TraceDB: 查询慢 Trace&#10;    TraceDB--&gt;&gt;Grafana: 返回 Trace waterfall&#10;    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Grafana: 点击异常 Span&#10;    Grafana-&gt;&gt;LogDB: 查询 trace_id=xxx AND span_id=yyy&#10;    LogDB--&gt;&gt;Grafana: 返回该 Span 时间窗内的日志&#10;    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Engineer: 发现 &quot;connection pool exhausted&quot; ERROR\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Engineer as 工程师\n    participant Grafana as 可视化层\n    participant TraceDB as Trace 存储\n    participant LogDB as 日志存储\n\n    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Grafana: 看到 P99 延迟异常\n    Grafana-&gt;&gt;TraceDB: 查询慢 Trace\n    TraceDB--&gt;&gt;Grafana: 返回 Trace waterfall\n    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Grafana: 点击异常 Span\n    Grafana-&gt;&gt;LogDB: 查询 trace_id=xxx AND span_id=yyy\n    LogDB--&gt;&gt;Grafana: 返回该 Span 时间窗内的日志\n    Engineer-&gt;&gt;Engineer: 发现 \"connection pool exhausted\" ERROR</pre><h2 id=\"查询性能调优清单\">查询性能调优清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th align=\"center\">适用后端</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缩小时间范围</td>\n<td align=\"center\">所有</td>\n<td>线性减少扫描量</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先使用 indexed label/column 过滤</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Loki/CH</td>\n<td>指数级减少扫描量</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免前缀通配符 <code>*timeout</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">ES</td>\n<td>避免全量扫描</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 Bloom Filter 索引</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Loki 3.x/CH</td>\n<td>快速排除不含目标 token 的块</td>\n<td>额外存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Query Frontend 分片</td>\n<td align=\"center\">Loki</td>\n<td>并行化大范围查询</td>\n<td>计算资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物化视图预聚合</td>\n<td align=\"center\">CH</td>\n<td>聚合查询从秒级到毫秒级</td>\n<td>额外存储 + 写放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果缓存</td>\n<td align=\"center\">所有</td>\n<td>相同查询秒级返回</td>\n<td>内存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>掌握查询模式之后，下一步是将高频查询自动化为<a href=\"log-based-alerting\">基于日志的告警</a>——让系统代替人执行持续的查询监控。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>高效的日志查询建立在对存储引擎索引机制的理解之上。核心原则：缩小时间范围是所有后端的通用优化、优先用 indexed label/column 过滤缩小扫描范围、避免全量扫描（如前缀通配符）。跨信号关联通过 trace_id 实现日志与 Trace 的双向跳转，是现代可观测性 workflow 的基础能力。物化视图预聚合是 ClickHouse 环境下聚合查询的杀手级优化。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日志查询模式","id":"日志查询模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"查询类型分类","id":"查询类型分类"},{"level":2,"text":"LogQL 查询模式（Loki）","id":"logql-查询模式-loki"},{"level":3,"text":"基础模式","id":"基础模式"},{"level":3,"text":"聚合模式","id":"聚合模式"},{"level":3,"text":"性能优化要诀","id":"性能优化要诀"},{"level":2,"text":"SQL 查询模式（ClickHouse）","id":"sql-查询模式-clickhouse"},{"level":3,"text":"基础查询","id":"基础查询"},{"level":3,"text":"分析查询","id":"分析查询"},{"level":3,"text":"ClickHouse 查询性能的关键：主键排序","id":"clickhouse-查询性能的关键-主键排序"},{"level":2,"text":"ES|QL 查询模式（Elasticsearch）","id":"es-ql-查询模式-elasticsearch"},{"level":2,"text":"跨信号关联查询","id":"跨信号关联查询"},{"level":2,"text":"查询性能调优清单","id":"查询性能调优清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"日志解析与富化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/pipeline/log-parsing-enrichment"},"next":{"title":"基于日志的告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-based-alerting"}}